sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Caller as Caller / Edge
    actor Android as Android Client HUD
    participant Ingest as FastAPI Ingestion Buffer
    participant AI as Parallel AI Engines
    participant GRU as GRU Temporal Engine
    participant Policy as Policy & Decision Engine
    participant Dash as React Dashboard
    participant Audit as Forensics & SOS Dispatcher

    Caller->>Android: Incoming Call Event
    Android->>Ingest: WebSocket Handshake (/ws/call/{session_id})
    
    rect rgb(30, 27, 75)
        note right of Android: Streaming Frame Loop (Every 1–2s Chunk)
        Android->>Ingest: Base64 PCM Audio Chunk
        Ingest->>AI: Dispatch Preprocessed Waveform & Spectrogram Features
        
        par Voice Authenticity
            AI->>AI: WavLM/AASIST Inference (synth_prob: 0.94)
        and Speaker Verification
            AI->>AI: ECAPA-TDNN Cosine Match (speaker_sim: 0.42)
        and Multilingual STT
            AI->>AI: faster-whisper ASR (transcript text)
        and Conversation Intelligence
            AI->>AI: XLM-R + Indic NLP (intent: MONEY_TRANSFER, tactics: URGENCY)
        end

        AI->>GRU: Parallel Evidence Vector E_t
        GRU->>GRU: Update Rolling Hidden State h_t = GRU(h_{t-1}, E_t)
        GRU->>Policy: Evaluate Dynamic Risk Score (R_t = 94 CRITICAL)
        
        Policy->>Policy: Match Policy Rules: Band = CRITICAL, Action = INTERVENE
        
        Policy-->>Android: Risk Update Payload (CRITICAL + 10s Countdown)
        Policy-->>Dash: Telemetry Update (Live Risk Radar & Spectrogram)
        
        Android->>Android: Render Floating Warning & 10s Intervention Countdown Overlay
        
        opt Risk >= 90 (CRITICAL)
            Policy-->>Audit: Dispatch Dual-Language Family Safety SOS Alert
            Policy-->>Audit: Seal Evidence Frame with SHA-256 Hash Chain
        end
    end

    note over Android, Audit: Call Termination & Post-Call Forensics
    Android->>Ingest: Call Teardown Event
    Ingest->>Audit: Generate Section 65B Dossier & CyberCrime 1930 Payload
